  "contentHtml": "<p>이곳 카페에서&#160;<span style=\"color: #444444;\">&#160;정수금(시흥) 선생님 자료 덕분에 막막하던 주제선택 수업을 &#39;영화 속 과학탐구&#39;로 운영하고 있습니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #444444;\">정수금 선생님 기존틀을 활용해 영화 레디 플레이어 원 수업자료 간단히 만들었습니다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><b><span style=\"color: #444444;\">[수업 전체 구성]</span></b></p><p><span style=\"color: #444444;\">-저희는 2시간 블록이라, 1차시는 영화 간단히 소개후 요약 영상 시청( 약 27분 영상으로 꽤 김)</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #444444;\">-2차시는 본격적으로 관련된 특정 과학 개념에 대해 관련 영상을 따로 더 보거나 강의, 학습지, 퀴즈 등 그때 그때 다릅니다^^;</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><b><span style=\"color: #444444;\">&lt;1차시&gt; 영화 요약 영상 시청</span></b></p><p><span style=\"color: #444444;\">(27분 14초)</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #444444;\"><a href=\"https://youtu.be/N2i40ZKIaao\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/N2i40ZKIaao</a></span></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=N2i40ZKIaao&amp;feature=youtu.be\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"868\" data-video-height=\"488\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/f2dX5/hyKD1TqwCf/Y5BCHpxN2XINX7jPZB2kRk/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"868\" data-video-origin-height=\"488\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/N2i40ZKIaao\" width=\"868\" height=\"488\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p><b>&lt;2차시&gt; 활동지 작성</b></p><p>-영화 감상평 발표하기</p><p>-가상현실vs증강현실 비교하기</p><p>(6분 49초)</p><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/8IsdCz1U5uM\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/8IsdCz1U5uM</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8IsdCz1U5uM&amp;feature=youtu.be\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"851\" data-video-height=\"479\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/7Rzkj/hyKDXQ1ICt/FxuDWSHzIOtSdRunyqy0eK/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"851\" data-video-origin-height=\"479\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/8IsdCz1U5uM\" width=\"851\" height=\"479\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>-실감기술 활용 아이디어 발표하기</p><p>:아이들 활용 아이디어 발표 먼저 듣고난 후에 다음 영상(VR기술로 죽은 딸과 엄마가 만남) 보고 마무리</p><p>(4분 55초)</p><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/O411OKAygSg\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/O411OKAygSg</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=O411OKAygSg&amp;feature=youtu.be\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"851\" data-video-height=\"479\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/vXGvm/hyKDVMsWiS/OqEt59KeGjop0QswPh1lAK/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=280_132_1110_576\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"851\" data-video-origin-height=\"479\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/O411OKAygSg\" width=\"851\" height=\"479\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>-학생용</p><p>-교사용</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3dc43c5f73f0ec105252ab1cc1670320b63fd495?download\" data-file-name=\"12. 레디 플레이어 원(21.06.22.).hwp\" data-file-size=\"1229824\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DdSQv%26dataid%3D264%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20210622005117&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.